  "prompts": {
    "states": "Production 2D sprite sheet using EXACT attached current ripjaws design as identity reference. Classic pale gray-white fish humanoid with dark-green dorsal head/back fin, ONE attached anglerfish forehead lure ending in yellow bulb, small dark round eye, huge tooth-filled jaw with yellow pointed teeth, long clawed hands, black torso/waist suit and chest Omnitrix. Preserve current same pale body/green fins/black suit; two arms/two legs, no shark transformation. Exactly8 separate complete FULL-BODY RIGHT-facing/three-quarter figures in4 columns x2rows, row-major: 1 Deep-sea-frenzy anticipation crouching, jaw opening and clawed arms drawn back;2 active forward BITE lunge to RIGHT, jaws WIDE open, attached yellow-bulb lure sweeping back, claws reaching and legs pushing, same fish humanoid body;3 jaws closing and claw arms retracting into landing/recovery;4 neutral standing matching reference;5 defensive forearms guard;6 upright hit recoil feet planted;7 defeated side lying, lure intact;8 low running dash. Crisp TV-cartoon black outlines and flat original-series cel shading, same body/head across poses. Effects will be animated separately: NO energy, flames, water, tornados, roots erupting outside body, long launched bandages, rocks, auras, trails, floor, cast shadows, text or labels. Opaque bodies on true transparency. Native upright-equivalent detail400-470px, quadruped body height330-400px; whole limbs/lure/appendages safely inside canvas,30px clear outer margins and gutters, no touching/overlap/cropping."
  },
